      "content": "that's a good start. you mentioned how they see these shifts \"eroding\" objective spiritual reality and causing a \"fragmentation\" of social bonds. can you expand on that? why do they see these changes as being so inherently destructive to the moral fabric of society rather than just being a different way of living?",
